  <!-- ============================================================================ HOUSING ==
    A roof is a binding support: no amount of water feeds somebody with nowhere to sleep.
    The ladder is four designs, not four rungs of one. A tent goes up in an afternoon and
    keeps nobody warm; a timber hut is a hut; a stone house is where a family stays; and
    the fine house is a different good entirely - quality against quantity, and the only
    thing a legendary trader will consent to live in.
  -->
