  <!-- ========================================================================= YARDS ==
    The chain's middle link. Clearance and salvage give the settlement raw stock; a yard turns
    two loads of it into one of something better, and nothing else in the game does. Refines is
    the whole of what makes a building a yard, so a third party's own sawmill counts the moment
    it declares one.

    They are also what a big work is raised BEHIND: a large design wants the yard its material
    implies standing and staffed, and a grand one wants it headed by a notable. That is why they
    are Steading work and cheap - a town that has not built them is a town that cannot start its
    temple, and it should never be a surprise.
  -->
