  <!-- ======================================================================== POWER ==
    The works keep the plots they were always standing on; what changed is that they now
    declare the ground they take, so the plan can budget for them. Power is civic labour
    before it is anything else: the crank mill is three settlers and a handle, and it is
    the first rung of the same ladder that ends in the ancients' own machinery.

    The molten-salt store keeps the day's power for the night.
  -->
